=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Notice:}** Wait one game day and re-zone after completing {q:Light in the Darkness|Light in the Darkness|Light in the Darkness} before starting this quest.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger (S)} in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} at (H-6) for a cutscene that begins the quest.
* Speak to {n:Engelhart} in Bastok Markets (S) at (K-10).
* From {z:Batallia Downs (S)}, use the (J-10) entrance to {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)}.
** The quickest way is via {p:Survival Guide} to {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)}.
** Alternatively: via Voidwatch teleport (Jeuno I)
* Go to the southern room at (G-9) and fall down the center hole. Follow the path, then make a left turn at the fork and go up the stairs. At the top, enter the room to the north at (I-7). Check the Sarcophagus on the east side of the room for a cutscene.
** There are four {p:Orcs|Category:Orc} in this room, so either clear them out before you watch the cutscene or wait for them to turn to drop invisible.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger (S)} for a cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Blatherix} at (F-8) for your reward.
** You should keep this {i:Elixir|Elixir|4145} for use in a later mission, {q:The Truth Lies Hid|The Truth Lies Hid|The Truth Lies Hid}.

If you are working on missions then return to {p:Cait Sith (Mission)}.
